      <Docs>
        <summary>Map, and reorder canonically.</summary>
        <value>The normalization mode that applies decomposition mappings and canonical reordering without composition.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Map, and reorder canonically. Same as standard NFD when using an "nfc" instance. Same as standard NFKD when using an "nfkc" instance. For details about standard Unicode normalization forms see https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr15/</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/icu/text/Normalizer2.Mode#DECOMPOSE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.icu.text.Normalizer2.Mode.DECOMPOSE</code>.</a></format></para>
